(define (problem temp)(:domain cube)(:objects 
   p1  - pos 
   p2  - pos 
   p3  - pos 
   p4  - pos 
   p5  - pos 
   p6  - pos 
   p7  - pos 
   p8  - pos 
   int1  - interpretation 
   int2  - interpretation 
   int3  - interpretation 
   int4  - interpretation 
)
(:init (true)
  (y p5 int1)
  (x p1 int1)
  (z p5 int1)
  (x p4 int2)
  (z p5 int2)
  (y p1 int2)
  (y p5 int3)
  (z p6 int3)
  (x p1 int3)
  (x p5 int4)
  (y p7 int4)
  (z p2 int4)
)
(:goal (forall (?interpr - interpretation)(and   (x p5 ?interpr)  (y p5 ?interpr)  (z p5 ?interpr)))))